@startuml system-diagram-simple
title Solvay Spark Spine AI — Architecture at a glance

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #666666
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #333333
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #111111
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #666666
}
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
left to right direction

actor "Analyst" as User
rectangle "Web UI\nReact SPA" as UI
rectangle "FastAPI + Guardrails\n:8000" as API
rectangle "Ingestion\nDocling · OCR → Markdown" as ING
rectangle "RAG system\nchunk · Ollama bge-m3\nhybrid search" as RAG
rectangle "Knowledge graph\nknowledge_graph.json\nBFS · 2-hop" as KG
database "Neo4j 5 Community\nread-only copy · Cypher" as NEO
rectangle "Agents\nEvidence · InsightLens\nFit-Gap Copilot" as AGENTS
rectangle "Hindsight\nagent memory" as MEM
rectangle "Ragas evaluation\nanswer quality" as RAGAS
database "PostgreSQL + pgvector\nchunks · runs · uploads" as PG
cloud "Anthropic Claude" as CLAUDE
cloud "Langfuse Cloud\ntraces · scores" as LF

User --> UI : HTTPS
UI --> API : REST · SSE
API --> ING : convert
ING --> RAG : Markdown
ING --> KG : Markdown
API --> RAG : embed · ask
API --> KG : rebuild
API --> AGENTS : run
RAG --> PG : vectors · BM25
KG --> PG : reads chunks
KG --> NEO : load whole
API --> NEO : Cypher (Claude-written)
AGENTS --> RAG : search tool
AGENTS --> KG : graph tools
AGENTS --> MEM : recall · retain
AGENTS --> PG : store run
AGENTS --> CLAUDE : tool-use loop
RAG --> CLAUDE : answer
AGENTS --> LF : traces · scores
RAG --> LF : traces
API --> RAGAS : score answer
RAGAS --> CLAUDE : judges
RAGAS --> LF : scores

note bottom of LF
  Simplified: the corpus files, Ollama,
  NL → Cypher module and scope classifier are
  folded in. Full view: system-diagram.png.
  Dark boxes = external services.
end note

@enduml
